      "quote": "First, no first-party source checked for this article defines the exact semantics of the 1M ceiling — whether streaming, multi-turn continuation, or per-attempt accounting applies. Second, Google has not published a rate limit, latency, or time-to-first-token figure alongside the limit. Third, because Argon has no model ID in the public API documentation as of September 30, there is currently no way for an outside developer to test the claim directly.",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "TEXT_RANGE",
